@prefix : <https://example.org/smoke/baseline#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# Trivial subClassOf transitivity check.
# Proves the harness pipeline end-to-end: union ontology + this fixture
# fed to EYE, the deductive closure parsed by rdflib, the companion
# baseline.ask exercised over the closure.
#
# This fixture does NOT exercise the cardano: vocabulary; it exists so
# that adding the harness in this slice is bisect-safe (the harness
# fails non-trivially if the EYE/rdflib glue breaks, even before the
# Phase B OWL axioms land).

:A rdfs:subClassOf :B .
:B rdfs:subClassOf :C .

:thing a :A .

# Subsumption rules (EYE has no built-in RDFS closure; declare what we
# rely on here so the smoke is self-contained).
{ ?S rdf:type ?X . ?X rdfs:subClassOf ?Y } => { ?S rdf:type ?Y } .
{ ?X rdfs:subClassOf ?Y . ?Y rdfs:subClassOf ?Z } => { ?X rdfs:subClassOf ?Z } .
